      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Cooperative account balance exceeds credit limit (W5307) or payment is overdue (&gt; 45 days)
Frequency: Daily review cycle
Volume: ~10-15 credit hold events annually
Owner: B2B Credit Director
Participants: Accounts Receivable Supervisor, POS Cashier
Source: workflow W5311 — Cooperative Credit Hold Flagging and Delinquency Lockout</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5311_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5311_Lane1" name="Accounts Receivable Supervisor">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5311_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
